<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw WITHOUT time
aggregation (<aggregateBy key="Hour"/>, <outputtimestep value="Hour"/>; July
2020, weekdays, two hours; road types 1 and 4), for the gasoline passenger car
(21) and the diesel combination long-haul truck (62): NonHAPTOG (88) and its
mechanism pseudo-pollutant (3000, "NonHAPTOG Mechanism", mechanism 5 -- the
only mechanism MOVES5 ships; TOGSpeciationCalculator writes NonHAPTOG wherever
it is selected) at running and start exhaust, extended idle, auxiliary power
and crankcase running, start and extended idle, beside the prerequisites
TOGSpeciationCalculator.getMechanismRequirements and the chain expand them to:
NMOG and the fourteen integrated species, and THC, NMHC and VOC at the
rated processes. NonHAPTOG is a pollutant-process only at 1 and 15
(pollutantProcessAssoc 8801, 8815); the mechanism is one at all seven.
N2O has no pair at extended idle, APU or the crankcase processes and is not
selected. No PM, no evaporative or refueling process. County database
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.]]></description>
